# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:6
translate chinese rikusecret_c29dd21c:

    # "The midday sun hung high over Arcadia’s newly restored athletics track."
    "正午的阳光高悬在Arcadia新修复的体育场上空。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:7
translate chinese rikusecret_a9a97861:

    # "With athletics and sport returning to the city, [rik] had invited me here, saying I should check it out sometime if I was ever interested in running."
    "随着体育活动的再一次兴起，[rik]告诉我，说如果我对跑步感兴趣的话，有机会可以来转转。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:8
translate chinese rikusecret_6b6220ea:

    # "Flying wasn’t an option for me, but hey, why not? I’ve been slacking on my cardio."
    "虽然我没长翅膀飞不起来，但为什么不来散散步呢？我最近确实没怎么运动。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:11
translate chinese rikusecret_4f1f475e:

    # "[rik] was near the starting line, stretching out her legs in her natural element."
    "[rik] 坐在起跑线附近，伸展着双腿，为接下来的高强度运动做着热身。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:12
translate chinese rikusecret_8b08369e:

    # mc "So this is where you’ve been sneaking off to."
    mc "原来你一直都躲在这搞运动啊。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:13
translate chinese rikusecret_e415db83:

    # rik "Pfft. I don’t sneak off. I make ‘grand exits.’"
    rik "噗。什么叫躲？我每天都来的好吧。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:14
translate chinese rikusecret_d403216f:

    # "She turned, smirking, before settling into another deep stretch, sitting on the sand with both legs extended."
    "她转过身，对我露出了得意的笑容，随后又开始做起了另一组伸展运动。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:15
translate chinese rikusecret_30234da3:

    # "As she moved, her toned frame shifted, lean muscle beneath a smooth layer of fur."
    "她那健美的身躯随着动作微微扭动，紧实的肌肉在光滑的绒毛下若隐若现。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:16
translate chinese rikusecret_ae045e35:

    # mc "Hmm… Sand… Coarse, rough, ends up everywhere… There certainly are some downsides to this nude society."
    mc "嗯…这里到处都是…粗糙……坚硬的沙子……这种裸体社会确实有不少缺点。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:17
translate chinese rikusecret_a8258b46:

    # rik "Oh? Getting flustered already? At least I’ve got fur. That’s like… built-in modesty."
    rik "哦？这就慌了？起码我身上长了一层毛，对于你来说.....就是天生的优势吧。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:18
translate chinese rikusecret_861b846f:

    # mc "Is that what we’re calling it? Because from where I’m standing, that fur is not exactly… covering much."
    mc "原来你们是这么叫它的。老实说吧，其实覆盖的也没那么全面，从我这看.....还是有一部分没长毛的"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:19
translate chinese rikusecret_7c9a53b8:

    # rik "If you’re staring, just say it. No need to dance around it~"
    rik "我知道你在说哪里，没必要这么含蓄，直接说出来多好~"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:20
translate chinese rikusecret_13be5f64:

    # rik "Or perhaps you're jealous? Wish you had a body like mine?"
    rik "还是说你在嫉妒我吗？是不是也想要一个像我这样健美的身材？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:21
translate chinese rikusecret_bd61cd14:

    # mc "Jealous? No. Thoroughly distracted? … Maybe."
    mc "嫉妒？没有。分心？……可能吧。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:22
translate chinese rikusecret_f43da945:

    # rik "Yeah, yeah. If you want to catch a glimpse of my ass, you’ll have to keep up first~"
    rik "好啦，好啦~。如果你能跟得上我，说不定我会让你好好地欣赏欣赏我的翘臀~"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:24
translate chinese rikusecret_b4c9fc11:

    # "Before I could throw another retort, a sharp whistle cut through the air."
    "在我出言怼回去之前，一声尖锐的哨声划破了空气。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:26
translate chinese rikusecret_a5b3b800:

    # "A new figure approached from the side of the track. A fiery pegasus mare."
    "一道身影沿着跑道走了过来。那是一匹火辣的飞马。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:28
translate chinese rikusecret_02ce2513:

    # misc "Didn’t think I’d be seeing you back here, [rik]."
    misc "没想到我们又在这里见面了，[rik]。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:30
translate chinese rikusecret_2516e4e3:

    # rik "Coach Stormflare!?"
    rik "Stormflare教练？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:31
translate chinese rikusecret_cef639e4:

    # mc "Coach?"
    mc "教练？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:33
translate chinese rikusecret_ea528c76:

    # misc "That’s right. Former captain of the Stormchasers Flight Division, now coaching the next generation of speedsters."
    misc "没错，我以前在\"逐风者\"飞行队当过一段时间的教练，现在的话，在给新一批的学员们做教练"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:34
translate chinese rikusecret_2b06d0b4:

    # misc "And what do I find? My old star athlete goofing around with some ground-pounder instead of training."
    misc "而我刚刚发现了什么？昔日的明星运动员竟然在和一个菜鸟鬼混，而不是在努力训练？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:36
translate chinese rikusecret_d916330e:

    # rik "Ohoho… You’re the same as ever, Coach. Even you can’t admit that I’ve earned my goofing-off time, can you?"
    rik "……你还是老样子，教练。你还是不承认我的成功，不肯让我休息，对吧？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:38
translate chinese rikusecret_d9fc6c64:

    # misc "You always were full of yourself, [rik]."
    misc "你还是那么的自傲，[rik]。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:39
translate chinese rikusecret_cc6941b2:

    # misc "You’ve got your place in history. Sure, you helped rebuild the sports scene, got the city back on the track; but I only care about who’s fastest."
    misc "确实，你在历史书上留下了你的名字，你领头重建了体育界，让这座城市重回正轨；但我现在只关心你还够不够快。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:41
translate chinese rikusecret_48ef8f49:

    # misc "That’s not you. You’re way out of practice."
    misc "和一个菜鸟鬼混可不像你。你不会真的变慢了吧？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:43
translate chinese rikusecret_3c3c6b2a:

    # rik "Damn, Coach. Didn’t think you’d write me off so {i}fast{/i}."
    rik "我去，教练。没想到你会这么{i}快{/i}就想着要放弃我。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:44
translate chinese rikusecret_a2474220:

    # rik "And here I thought you’d be at least a little sentimental."
    rik "我还以为你会稍微感性一点呢。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:46
translate chinese rikusecret_a9120a51:

    # misc "Sentimental? I train winners, [rik]. Not nostalgia."
    misc "感性？我不会在老队员或新队员之间作取舍，我只练赢家，[rik]。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:48
translate chinese rikusecret_9e996632:

    # "[rik] wasn’t the soft type, never had been. She didn’t need approval or sappy encouragement. But something about how casually she was being dismissed... I could tell that stung."
    "[rik]从来都不是那种柔弱的马，从来都不是。她不需要别人的认可，也不需要那些肉麻的鼓励。但她被如此随意地忽视，我能感觉到那让她很受伤，同时也很不爽。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:50
translate chinese rikusecret_2acd1eaa:

    # rik "Alright. You wanna play it cold? Fine."
    rik "所以，你想试一试我？彳亍。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:51
translate chinese rikusecret_3852c2f5:

    # rik "Let’s make this interesting. How about a bet?"
    rik "那不如我们来打个赌，怎么样？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:53
translate chinese rikusecret_c0e9899b:

    # misc "Go on?"
    misc "怎么说？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:55
translate chinese rikusecret_7e921aa2:

    # rik "You say I’m old news, but do you think your new blood is better than me?"
    rik "你说我已经过气了，不是吗？那你凭什么认为那些新来的就比我快呢？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:56
translate chinese rikusecret_b347fbce:

    # rik "Then put your monies where your mouth is."
    rik "那不如我们就来赌一赌。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:58
translate chinese rikusecret_840dfad8:

    # rik "If I can outspeed your fastest racer, you’ve gotta put up something meaningful."
    rik "如果你最快的学员也快不过我的话，你就得......."

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:60
translate chinese rikusecret_dd3acc21:

    # rik "Let’s say… your body. For [mc] over here."
    rik "就得……我们先假设一下，[mc]对你很有性趣。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:61
translate chinese rikusecret_742901db:

    # mc "Wha?!"
    mc "啥？！"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:63
translate chinese rikusecret_20dd9f40:

    # misc "Pftt… What?! Have you lost your mind? I’m happily married."
    misc "不是……你说什么？！你疯了吗？我可是已经结婚了，而且婚姻很美满，好吧。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:65
translate chinese rikusecret_d8101648:

    # rik "Come on, Coach. You’re so sure your racer is better than me, right? You wouldn’t lose. So what’s the harm?"
    rik "来吧，风教练。你不是对你的学员很有信心吗？你又输不了，为什么不赌一赌呢？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:67
translate chinese rikusecret_308d5493:

    # misc "Does your ground-pounder even agree to this?"
    misc "那....你的地勤有什么看法呢？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:72
translate chinese rikusecret_e7142e5e:

    # misc "… Really? Huh…"
    misc "...真的吗？好吧...."

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:75
translate chinese rikusecret_a9591ff1:

    # rik "Awh, man! Forget the stakes then. Let’s just do the race."
    rik "哎呀，那算了！那就不赌了，直接比赛吧。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:77
translate chinese rikusecret_2a28afd3:

    # misc "Hm… Alright."
    misc "唔.....行吧。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:83
translate chinese rikusecret_826b4680:

    # "… [rik] and Stormflare’s fastest racer, a stallion built for speed, stepped up to the starting line."
    "……[rik]和风暴之焰最快的学员，一匹为速度而生的雄驹，迈步走向了起跑线。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:84
translate chinese rikusecret_02a7a4df:

    # misc "Alright. Standard track rules. First one to complete a full lap wins. No dirty tricks, no complaints."
    misc "好。标准规则。第一个跑完一整圈的马获胜。禁止作弊，不接受任何问题。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:86
translate chinese rikusecret_3cd82065:

    # rik "Yeah, yeah. Just say the word, Coach."
    rik "知道啦。快开赛吧，风教练。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:87
translate chinese rikusecret_19deec86:

    # misc "On your marks."
    misc "各就各位。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:88
translate chinese rikusecret_b0281bb8:

    # misc "Set—"
    misc "预备———"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:89
translate chinese rikusecret_776ee0a0:

    # misc "GO!"
    misc "跑！"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:94
translate chinese rikusecret_1555a6fb:

    # "*BOOM!*"
    "*呯！*"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:95
translate chinese rikusecret_2eda966f:

    # "One second, [rik] had been standing beside her opponent."
    "一秒前，[rik]还站在对手的身边。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:96
translate chinese rikusecret_99a1d8ae:

    # "The next, a rainbow sonic boom had split the air."
    "下一秒，一道彩虹般的音爆就撕裂了空气。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:97
translate chinese rikusecret_376e6ef7:

    # "The other racer hadn’t even moved yet. He couldn’t after seeing that."
    "另一位参赛者都没时间起步。不过当他看到那一幕后，他也没那个心情去起步了。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:98
translate chinese rikusecret_f1f01fd7:

    # "Stormflare was frozen, her mouth slightly open, eyes wide with disbelief."
    "风暴之焰愣住了，她的嘴微微张开，眼睛瞪得老大，脸上满是难以置信的神情。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:103
translate chinese rikusecret_7c6445c7:

    # "By the time the dust settled. [rik] was already standing at the finish line. Hands on her hips."
    "当彩虹音爆带起的尘埃落地时，[rik]已经站在了终点线前，双手叉腰。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:105
translate chinese rikusecret_9b185204:

    # misc "You—"
    misc "你——"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:106
translate chinese rikusecret_a3fbadfb:

    # "[rik] grinned, stepping forward slowly, savoring every step."
    "[rik]咧嘴一笑，慢慢地向她走了过去，细细品味着她迈出的每一步。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:108
translate chinese rikusecret_2916832c:

    # rik "Coach. You really thought I stopped competing because I got slow?"
    rik "风教练。你真的以为我是因为变慢了才退役的？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:109
translate chinese rikusecret_6dcec8ac:

    # rik "I stopped competing... because I’m too fast~"
    rik "错啦~我退赛是因为我实在是太快了，谁都赢不了我，我嫌无聊才退役的~"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:111
translate chinese rikusecret_527653c3:

    # misc "Hah, haha… [rik], are you sure you don’t want to join the team?"
    misc "哈哈，好啊你小子……[rik]，你确定不想归队吗？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:113
translate chinese rikusecret_ab9db857:

    # rik "Just admit that you were wrong, and I’ll be on my way."
    rik "我不想。承认你的错误，我才会离开。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:114
translate chinese rikusecret_fc33a7e6:

    # misc "Sheesh… You always were my best student. Guess you’ll always be my fastest too."
    misc "天啊……你一直都是我最好的学员。看来你永远都会是最快的飞马了。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:116
translate chinese rikusecret_0fab1959:

    # misc "No… I’ll train someone faster, one day."
    misc "不过嘛……总有一天，我肯定能练出来一个比你更快的飞马。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:118
translate chinese rikusecret_de90fb69:

    # rik "That’s the spirit, but somehow… I don’t think you will~"
    rik "想法是好的，但我觉得吧.....恐怕不太可能~"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:121
translate chinese rikusecret_6056bbc4:

    # misc "Hm… Alright. You want me to put my body on the line? Fine."
    misc "嗯......好吧。你想拿我的身体来当赌注？我接受。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:122
translate chinese rikusecret_0c317721:

    # misc "But the stakes need to be fair, don’t they?"
    misc "但赌注必须公平，不是吗？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:123
translate chinese rikusecret_f93f7b2b:

    # misc "My fastest new blood? He’s male and has long since had a crush on you. If you lose. You offer your body to him. No protection."
    misc "我最快的学员是个匹雄驹，而且一直都暗恋着你。如果你输了，你同样也得和他.....你懂的，并且不做保护措施。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:124
translate chinese rikusecret_d1bd87a0:

    # misc "If he does knock you up, I’ll be looking forward to training train your child. Joking, of course~"
    misc "如果他真的让你怀孕了，我期待着训练你的孩子。当然，我开玩笑的~"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:126
translate chinese rikusecret_2d6383a3:

    # rik "Hmph…"
    rik "哼....."

