# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:165
translate chinese rikusecret_04eb1257:

    # "Stormflare pressed her hands to the supply closet wall, bracing herself against it, breath coming slow and steady."
    "风暴之焰双手紧贴在储物室的墙上，用力支撑着自己，呼吸缓慢而平稳。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:166
translate chinese rikusecret_e500e737:

    # "[rik] stood at her side, mirroring her position as she watched the unfolding scene with a bright grin."
    "[rik]站在她身旁，与她保持着相同的姿势，脸上挂着灿烂的笑容，目不转睛地看着眼前展开的场景。"

