# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:587
translate chinese dawnsecret_ce50c4de:

    # "My hands settled onto her waist, fingers pressing against soft, heated skin. She shivered, but her expression remained full of mischief."
    "我的双手轻轻抚在她的腰间，指尖触碰着她温暖而柔软的绒毛。她微微颤抖，但表情依然充满着欲望。"

