# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:898
translate chinese lilysecret_e421a2ab:

    # mc "We'll just have to find out~"
    mc "我们会知道的~"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:901
translate chinese lilysecret_37f1a0fd:

    # "As I slowly push into her warmth, [lil] gasps softly, eyes widening. Her insides tighten around me, pulling me deeper. She shivers beneath me, adjusting quickly to the thick insertion."
    "当我缓缓进入她的温暖的肉穴时，[lil]轻轻的叫出了声，双眼睁大。她的肉壶紧紧吸着我，意图让我更加深入她。她在我身下颤抖，迅速适应了我的插入。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:902
translate chinese lilysecret_f7a53384:

    # lil "Ngghh, I knew it… it's way better than I imagined~"
    lil "嗯，我就知道……比我想像中舒服太多了~"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:906
translate chinese lilysecret_5899721b:

    # "I move slowly at first, letting her fully savor each gentle thrust. [lil]’s breathing becomes ragged, small moans slipping from her lips as her hips instinctively rise to meet mine."
    "我放慢了动作，让她充分感受着我每一次温柔的抽插。 [lil] 的呼吸渐渐变得急促，微小的呻吟从她唇间滑出，臀部下意识地抬高，迎合着我的动作。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:907
translate chinese lilysecret_af0bd451:

    # mc "Mmhh, you feel amazing. Just long have you been waiting tonight for me to pin you down and take you?"
    mc "嗯，你下面真舒服~。你今晚等了我多久？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:908
translate chinese lilysecret_223b4215:

    # lil "Longer than I'd admit! Ahhhh… please... don't stop~!"
    lil "其实比我说的还要久！啊~....…求求你……别停~！"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:909
translate chinese lilysecret_c4923fc4:

    # "I speed up gradually, responding to her eager encouragement, watching her expressions shift from shy curiosity to desperate pleasure. Each movement brings us closer, the intensity growing as her fingers dig into her thighs."
    "我逐渐加快了动作，回应她的求爱，看着她的表情从害羞的好奇逐渐转变为充满情欲的阿嘿颜。每一次抽插都让我们更加靠近高潮，随着她的手指深深嵌入了她大腿，激情愈发炽烈。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:910
translate chinese lilysecret_db818cd0:

    # lil "I-I think I'm gonna-! Aahhh, c-cuuumm!"
    lil "我——我感觉我要——！啊啊啊，要去了——！"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:911
translate chinese lilysecret_cdfd346e:

    # mc "Me too! I can’t hold back much longer!"
    mc "我也要射了！我再也忍不了了！"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:916
translate chinese lilysecret_5160c263:

    # "Her entire body trembles as she reaches her peak, voice breaking beautifully beneath me."
    "她全身颤抖着达到了高潮，娇嫩的呻吟萦绕在我耳旁。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:921
translate chinese lilysecret_e3b0aed0:

    # "I join her on that ride, pleasure erupting through my body as I finish deep inside her, filling her completely."
    "我与她一同踏上这段极乐之旅。当我深深地射进她体内时，愉悦感如潮水般涌遍我全身，喷出的热精将她的子宫完全填满。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:926
translate chinese lilysecret_5f13a625:

    # "When our bodies finally relax, still connected and breathing heavily, she stares up at me, eyes full of gentle wonder."
    "高潮的余韵渐渐消散，我们的私处仍然紧密相连，呼出的热气拂过彼此的皮肤。她抬头看着我，眼中满是温柔的惊奇。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:927
translate chinese lilysecret_15fc8657:

    # lil "Mmh… Would you mind if we stayed here, just like this, for a while?"
    lil "嗯……我们就这样躺一会吧，你看行不行呀？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:928
translate chinese lilysecret_779b838f:

    # mc "I’d love that."
    mc "乐意之至。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:929
translate chinese lilysecret_58917b79:

    # lil "With you by my side… I feel like I can do anything."
    lil "有你在身边……我觉得自己无所不能。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:930
translate chinese lilysecret_aaea7a54:

    # mc "You can. You always could. Sometimes you just need someone else to remind you."
    mc "当然。你一直都无所不能。有时候吧，只是需要有谁提醒你罢了。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:931
translate chinese lilysecret_d427c6fb:

    # lil "And you'll be there to catch me, even if I stumble?"
    lil "那......如果我跌倒了，你也会扶住我的，对吧？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:932
translate chinese lilysecret_0e45e325:

    # mc "Every single step. Future princess~"
    mc "不管你在哪跌倒，我都会做那个扶你的人。我未来的公主殿下~"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:934
translate chinese lilysecret_0bc01510:

    # "[lil] smiles warmly, settling back against me with a happy sigh, beneath the sea of stars."
    "[lil] 温暖地笑了笑，随后靠在了我的身上，愉悦的哼了一声，与我一同置于星海之中。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:943
translate chinese butpensecret_701f340e:

    # but "Ah, perfect timing!"
    but "啊，太巧了！"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:947
translate chinese butpensecret_66edfb3b:

    # "Stepping inside, I'm surprised to see [pen] of all people, already seated comfortably at the table, sipping tea and scribbling notes onto a worn notebook."
    "一踏进屋，我惊讶地发现[pen]竟然已经坐在屋里前，悠然自得地品着茶，在一本破旧的笔记本上记写着什么。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:948
translate chinese butpensecret_7f3df66c:

    # pen "If it isn't [penmc]! I didn't expect to find you out here tonight."
    pen "原来是你[penmc]！没想到今晚会在这里遇到你。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:949
translate chinese butpensecret_dd45d1f1:

    # mc "I could say the same! What brings you to the forest at this hour, [pen]?"
    mc "我也是这么想的！这么晚了，你来这做什么，[pen]？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:951
translate chinese butpensecret_a6dd4ac4:

    # pen "A once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. An ancient shrine recently uncovered by the Royal Arcadian College, untouched for centuries. They're letting us study it; within their annoyingly strict rules, anyway."
    pen "这是一个千载难逢的机会。情况是这样的：皇家学院最近发现了一座古老的神殿，这座神殿已尘封数百年。他们允许我们进行研究，不过得遵守他们那些头疼的严格规定。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:953
translate chinese butpensecret_a06fd919:

    # but "I’m learning that [pen] isn't exactly fond of rules."
    but "我发现[pen]似乎不太喜欢按规矩来。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:955
translate chinese butpensecret_418bb7ce:

    # pen "Rules are useful when they serve a purpose. But when they stifle progress, I find it morally imperative to bend them… just a little."
    pen "规则在正常情况下是很有用的。但当规则阻碍研究与进步时，我认为我有义务去打破它们……只是稍微打破一点点啦。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:956
translate chinese butpensecret_06e4a677:

    # mc "So, you've come to the expert for help bending the rules?"
    mc "所以，你来找专家帮忙钻空子了？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:958
translate chinese butpensecret_9a95ba95:

    # but "I wouldn't say expert."
    but "别这样，我不敢说自己是个专家。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:960
translate chinese butpensecret_63a99d95:

    # pen "Don't be humble, [but]. You've probably forgotten more about this forest than I'll ever learn. And considering your many talents, you're exactly the partner I need."
    pen "别谦虚了，[but]。你对这片森林的了解，恐怕比我一辈子学的都多。而且考虑到你其他方面的才华，你正是我需要的合作伙伴。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:962
translate chinese butpensecret_77ae6882:

    # but "Well, when you put it that way..."
    but "如果你这么的话，好吧……"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:964
translate chinese butpensecret_cd212c9a:

    # pen "And you, [penmc]? Care to join our little midnight expedition?"
    pen "那么，[penmc]？要不要加入我们的午夜探险？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:968
translate chinese butpensecret_82edc79b:

    # pen "Trouble? Noooo, it’s research! Valuable, historically significant, rule-breaking research."
    pen "麻烦？不不不，这是研究！有价值的、具有历史意义的、打破常规的研究~。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:970
translate chinese butpensecret_3c8df42a:

    # but "And now she's managed to drag both of us into it. Although, I rather like the excitement."
    but "现在她把我们俩个都卷进去了。不过嘛，我倒觉得这件事挺刺激的。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:973
translate chinese butpensecret_9da95f7d:

    # pen "Then it’s a good thing I pay in flattery and adventure. Come on, don’t make me beg."
    pen "这个缺口我就用我的侍奉和冒险来补上吧。加入我们吧，别让我再求你了。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:974
translate chinese butpensecret_0388bd9f:

    # mc "Well... Sure! Hanging out with you two promises to be fun."
    mc "好……我加入！和你们两个一起出去玩一定很有趣。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:977
translate chinese butpensecret_e04d30c1:

    # but "Of course~ I’ll make sure it’s one where you look brave and only slightly terrified!"
    but "当然啦~ 我会确保用一张勇敢又只带一点点害怕的照片！"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:979
translate chinese butpensecret_0f40be0c:

    # pen "Perfect! Then it's settled. We head out as soon as you’re ready."
    pen "太好了！那就这么定了。你准备好了我们就出发。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:981
translate chinese butpensecret_4fe1aac6:

    # but "I'll bring a few potions. You never know what you’ll find out there."
    but "我去拿几瓶药水，保险起见。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:984
translate chinese butpensecret_ed0a45a9:

    # "Stepping out into the moonlit forest, the air is filled with the gentle sounds of the night. After the disappearance of the darkness, this entire forest gets more pleasant by the day."
    "我们踏入了被月光笼罩的森林，空气中弥漫着夜晚常有的轻柔声。随着暗夜的消散，这片森林恢复了往日的宁静。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:987
translate chinese butpensecret_fa15cc16:

    # "[but] leads confidently, her steps graceful and purposeful, occasionally pausing to examine plants along the way."
    "[but]自信地向前走去，步伐优雅而坚定，偶尔停下脚步，仔细观察路边的植物。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:989
translate chinese butpensecret_c5a1ff65:

    # but "Oh, would you look at this! Moonglow caps. They're potent catalysts for night-based enchantments."
    but "哦，快看这是什么！月光帽。如果好好利用的话，会增强暗夜类魔法的效果。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:990
translate chinese butpensecret_ba4f8bf1:

    # but "These don’t usually grow this time of the year, but with recent changes… Who could possibly say?"
    but "这种植物通常不会在这个季节生长，但最近发生了这么多变化……谁又能说得准呢？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:992
translate chinese butpensecret_325c77c1:

    # pen "I recognize those! There are some being studied back at the college, but it sounds like you already know far more than they do."
    pen "我知道这种植物！我们学院也在研究这些，但听起来你已经比他们知道得多了。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:994
translate chinese butpensecret_446a8c31:

    # but "I've been familiar with the unique flora here for a long time. You can study all day and night, but you can't fully understand something until you put it into practice."
    but "我对这里独特的植物群落已经非常熟悉了。你可以日以继夜地去研究它，但实践才能出真知，不然你很难完全理解它的。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:996
translate chinese butpensecret_85907496:

    # pen "Heh, [but], you'd make a fantastic professor."
    pen "嘿，[but]，你肯定能成为一位出色的教授。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:998
translate chinese butpensecret_284de26c:

    # "[but] laughs, standing up with a small pouch of mushrooms."
    "[but]笑了笑，站了起来，手里拿着一个小袋子，里面装满了蘑菇。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:999
translate chinese butpensecret_85323bd0:

    # but "I'm not sure they'd accept my rather unconventional methods."
    but "我不确定他们是否会接受我这种非传统的做派。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1001
translate chinese butpensecret_6feb655e:

    # pen "I think that's exactly what they need. More practical knowledge, less bureaucracy."
    pen "我认为这正是我们学院所需要的。多些实践，少些繁文缛节。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1002
translate chinese butpensecret_d95d679c:

    # mc "[pen], do you ever stop thinking about overthrowing your professors?"
    mc "[pen]，你有没有想过解雇那些教授？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1004
translate chinese butpensecret_e37d384d:

    # pen "Only in my sleep... And even then, I dream about it."
    pen "这种恐怕只有在我的梦中才能实现了……我也梦见过他们被解雇。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1005
translate chinese butpensecret_ecc742a9:

    # pen "Someone's got to challenge the status quo. Otherwise, progress stalls."
    pen "必须有勇士挑战现状。否则，发展就会停滞不前。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1007
translate chinese butpensecret_5b6dfa08:

    # but "True… Though sometimes caution has its place. Especially with ancient magic."
    but "话是这么说……不过有时谨慎也是必要的。尤其是涉及古代魔法时。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1008
translate chinese butpensecret_df231c61:

    # mc "And that's exactly why it's good to have someone wise enough to keep us grounded."
    mc "这就是为什么我们需要有一个智囊，只有她才能让我们保持清醒。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1010
translate chinese butpensecret_77804b3c:

    # but "I agree! O-Oh, you meant m-me? I appreciate the compliment."
    but "我同意！哦，你指的是我-我吗？我非常感谢你的夸奖。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1012
translate chinese butpensecret_5a1bd131:

    # pen "You’re almost too smooth for our innocent [but]."
    pen "你啊，嘴这么甜，[but]怎么能架得住你这样夸她呢。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1013
translate chinese butpensecret_0f63243e:

    # mc "Hehe, you think she’s innocent?"
    mc "哈哈，你真觉得她是天然呆吗？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1015
translate chinese butpensecret_f88bb0ca:

    # but "Come on, the shrine is just ahead. Let's see what else we can discover tonight."
    but "快点，神社就在前面。看看我们今晚还能有什么新发现吧。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1017
translate chinese butpensecret_b5d8b7a3:

    # "As we step into the clearing, the shrine comes fully into view beneath a soft cascade of moonlight. The structure is ancient, weathered by countless seasons, but still imposing."
    "我们看到了立于空地上的神社，神龛在柔和的月光下逐渐显现。这座建筑古老而沧桑，历经无数个季节的洗礼，却依然雄伟壮观。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1019
translate chinese butpensecret_354a95b5:

    # "[pen] immediately rushes past the college’s blockades and tape."
    "[pen]立刻低身穿过了学院设置的警戒带。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1020
translate chinese butpensecret_202f1e5f:

    # pen "Would you look at this! It's even more impressive at night."
    pen "你们快看呀，晚上看着比白天漂亮多了。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1022
translate chinese butpensecret_875ef5dd:

    # but "Hm… It's been here a very long time. Longer than anyone realizes."
    but "嗯……它在这里已经很久了。比任何马想象的都要久。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1025
translate chinese butpensecret_2485cb8c:

    # pen "Uncertain. The College speculates it predates even our Old Arcadia records. Likely belonging to some ancient fertility or nature deity, though they’re annoyingly vague about details."
    pen "不确定。学院推测其年代甚至早于我们的旧Arcadia。很可能属于某位古代有关生育或自然的神灵，不过他们对细节的描述很复杂。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1027
translate chinese butpensecret_a5c3a06b:

    # but "You're not wrong. Something's been protecting the grounds subtly. Especially when you consider this was on the edge of Old Arcadia. Look at the moss growth… too clean, too precise."
    but "你没说错。这里确实有东西在暗中保护着这座神社。尤其是考虑到这里位于旧Arcadia的边缘地带。看看这片苔藓……长得太整齐，太干净了。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1028
translate chinese butpensecret_bb926c4c:

    # pen "What, really?!"
    pen "啊？真的吗？！"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1030
translate chinese butpensecret_d648f927:

    # pen "Whatever magical power this place once held seems to be long gone."
    pen "不管这个地方以前有过什么样的神奇力量，它现在已经消失了。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1032
translate chinese butpensecret_f3d769ee:

    # but "Actually... I sense a hint of magic in the air here. If we find its source, perhaps we could gain a better understanding?"
    but "其实吧……我能感觉到这里空气中弥漫着一丝魔法的气息。如果我们能找到它的来源，或许能帮助我们更深入的理解它？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1034
translate chinese butpensecret_ceba675e:

    # pen "R-Really? I can’t feel anything."
    pen "真的吗？我什么也没感觉到啊。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1036
translate chinese butpensecret_4dc59f7e:

    # but "I’ve been here before, and neither could I. Perhaps it’s because of the power I gained from the virtues’ relic? Can you confirm, [mc]?"
    but "我以前来过这里，我也做不到。或许是因为我从谐律之元中获得的力量，才能让我感受到这股魔法的？你能确认一下吗，[mc]？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1037
translate chinese butpensecret_4813cbc9:

    # mc "Hm… it’s really faint, but I can sense a little magic."
    mc "嗯……真的很微弱，但确实，我能感觉到一丝丝魔法的气息。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1039
translate chinese butpensecret_dd61f78e:

    # but "Faint? I can feel it very strongly, especially near this central marble slab."
    but "微弱吗？但我在这块中央的大理石板附近能非常强烈地感受到它。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1040
translate chinese butpensecret_f589877a:

    # mc "Could be a relic the college missed?"
    mc "可能是学院遗漏的遗物？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1044
translate chinese butpensecret_eda36615:

    # "I step up to the centre. it’s just a large slab of surprisingly well-kept stone."
    "我走到中央。上下打量着它，那只是一块出人意料地保存完好的巨大石板。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1045
translate chinese butpensecret_a20e2c99:

    # pen "Hard to say. This place looks like it was picked clean centuries ago, it's a marvel that the shrine itself still stands."
    pen "难说。这地方看起来像是几个世纪前就被不知道什么东西给洗劫一空了，神龛本身还能屹立不倒，实属奇迹。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1046
translate chinese butpensecret_571b1d75:

    # mc "Perhaps there’s something underneath the slab?"
    mc "或许在石板下面有什么东西？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1049
translate chinese butpensecret_afbb6498:

    # but "Not necessarily. Maybe this shrine never housed material things. I’m starting to think that this slab of stone itself is the thing imbued with magic."
    but "不一定。也许这座神龛从未供奉过任何实物。我开始觉得，或许这块石板本身就是块魔法之物。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1051
translate chinese butpensecret_63a33d8f:

    # pen "Wait, this entire slab {i}is{/i} the relic? What kind of magic is it emitting?"
    pen "等等，所以这整块石板{i}就是{/i}遗物？那它在释放什么魔法？"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1053
translate chinese butpensecret_f23b6ee4:

    # "[but] closes her eyes and tunes into her succubus instincts as she touches the slab."
    "[but]闭上眼睛，专注于触碰石板时涌现的魅魔本能。"

# game/6 .1 - Secrets.rpy:1055
